{"id": "msg_14bbffe4e20c4ea1975ad4d18df70b47", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "搜索超时了。改用成本最低的方式：直接按原样重放那次请求，把输出保存成语料文件。\n\n这正是关键点：如果**重放能复现**，那就不是“偶发”，而是有触发条件。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-12521de4c3714e5ea56e586046d63648", "tool_name": "write", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"content": "import json, time, urllib.request, os, sys\n\nOUT = r\"D:\\repository\\skills\\cursor-model-routing\\results\\offtask-composer-20261113.json\"\n\nQ = \"用一句话说明 Python 的 dict.get() 与 dict[] 取值的区别。\"\nrecords = []\n\nfor rep in range(1, 6):\n    body = json.dumps({\n        \"model\": \"cursor/composer-2.5\",\n        \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": Q}],\n        \"max_tokens\": 4096,   # 与配置的 6144 同量级，给足发散空间\n    }).encode()\n    req = urllib.request.Request(\n        \"http://127.0.0.1:3425/v1/chat/completions\",\n        data=body,\n        headers={\"Authorization\": \"Bearer magpie\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n    )\n    t0 = time.time()\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=240) as r:\n            d = json.loads(r.read())\n        c = d[\"choices\"][0][\"message\"][\"content\"] or \"\"\n        u = d.get(\"usage\") or {}\n        el = round(time.time() - t0, 1)\n        records.append({\n            \"src\": \"offtask-composer\", \"model\": \"cursor/composer-2.5\",\n            \"task\": \"DICTQ\", \"rep\": rep, \"elapsed\": el,\n            \"completion_tokens\": u.get(\"completion_tokens\"),\n            \"chars\": len(c), \"content\": c,\n        })\n        print(f\"rep{rep}: {el}s tok={u.get('completion_tokens')} chars={len(c)}\")\n        print(\"   head:\", c.strip().replace(\"\\n\", \" \")[:110])\n    except Exception as e:\n        el = round(time.time() - t0, 1)\n        print(f\"rep{rep}: FAILED {el}s {type(e).__name__}: {str(e)[:120]}\")\n        records.append({\"src\": \"offtask-composer\", \"model\": \"cursor/composer-2.5\",\n                        \"task\": \"DICTQ\", \"rep\": rep, \"elapsed\": el, \"error\": str(e)[:200], \"content\": \"\"})\n\nos.makedirs(os.path.dirname(OUT), exist_ok=True)\nwith open(OUT, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump(records, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1)\nprint(\"\\nWROTE\", OUT, \"n=\", len(records))\n", "file_path": "C:\\Users\\Administrator\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\replay_composer.py"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-13T07:45:48.901Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
