{"id": "msg_e176aafaaf534ca8bc82c2adff248e38", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "5 次重放全部是**正常 on-task** 输出（3.1–5.0s、68–115 tokens）。这说明单靠 prompt 不能复现，那次的触发条件不是这个请求本身。\n\n关键差异：偏题那次经过 `orchestrate op:\"tool\"` 路径，`max_tokens` 用的是配置的 **6144**，并且走的是带 `NO_LOCAL_FILE_SYSTEM` 的编排路径。我来测这两点。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-0691cfc2ecf44b909d64f90ba3232dde", "tool_name": "write", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"content": "import json, time, urllib.request, os\n\nOUT = r\"D:\\repository\\skills\\cursor-model-routing\\results\\offtask-composer-20261113.json\"\nQ = \"用一句话说明 Python 的 dict.get() 与 dict[] 取值的区别。\"\n\n# 复现 orchestrate 实际发的 messages：只有一条 user，无 system（op=tool 路径）\n# 但补上 NO_LOCAL_FILE_SYSTEM 作为 system，模拟 graph 路径的注入\nNO_LOCAL = (\n    \"严禁在没有本地文件读取权限的情况下输出任何猜测性代码或指导方案。\"\n    \"如果你无法读取目标路径，请只返回一句话：\"\n    \"[ERROR] 无法读取本地文件，请宿主提供源码片段。\"\n    \"禁止输出超过 20 个字的说明。\"\n)\n\ncases = []\nfor rep in range(1, 4):\n    cases.append((f\"nolsys-r{rep}\", [\n        {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": NO_LOCAL},\n        {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": Q},\n    ]))\nfor rep in range(1, 4):\n    cases.append((f\"maxtok6144-r{rep}\", [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": Q}]))\n\nexisting = []\nif os.path.exists(OUT):\n    with open(OUT, encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        existing = json.load(f)\n\nrecs = []\nfor name, msgs in cases:\n    mt = 6144 if name.startswith(\"maxtok\") else 4096\n    body = json.dumps({\"model\": \"cursor/composer-2.5\", \"messages\": msgs, \"max_tokens\": mt}).encode()\n    req = urllib.request.Request(\"http://127.0.0.1:3425/v1/chat/completions\", data=body,\n                                 headers={\"Authorization\": \"Bearer magpie\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"})\n    t0 = time.time()\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=240) as r:\n            d = json.loads(r.read())\n        c = d[\"choices\"][0][\"message\"][\"content\"] or \"\"\n        u = d.get(\"usage\") or {}\n        el = round(time.time() - t0, 1)\n        recs.append({\"src\": \"offtask-composer\", \"model\": \"cursor/composer-2.5\",\n                     \"task\": name, \"rep\": 1, \"elapsed\": el,\n                     \"completion_tokens\": u.get(\"completion_tokens\"),\n                     \"chars\": len(c), \"content\": c})\n        print(f\"{name}: {el}s tok={u.get('completion_tokens')} chars={len(c)}\")\n        print(\"   head:\", c.strip().replace(chr(10), ' ')[:100])\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"{name}: FAILED {type(e).__name__}: {str(e)[:120]}\")\n\nwith open(OUT, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump(existing + recs, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1)\nprint(\"\\nTOTAL\", len(existing) + len(recs))\n", "file_path": "C:\\Users\\Administrator\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\replay_variants.py"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-13T07:46:32.529Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
